# The world is copied over the committed stand-in page by
# `npm run world:sync -w @witness/fsv`, so a three-megabyte file passes
# through this folder on every developer's machine. Never let git rewrite
# line endings here: the design repo asserts its build reproduces that file
# byte for byte, and a line-ending pass on checkout quietly breaks the claim.
# Same rule, same reason, as apps/fsv/.gitattributes.
*.html -text -diff
